{"title":"오리엔트","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=4kedw/hAd4CqeYyU/zEyFhABDAZTSOypwQl5dRk&filename=th3","synopsis":"무사단― 그것은 결코 만족할 수 없는 꿈을 추구하는 집단.\n\n때는 전국, ‘도깨비’가 패권을 거머쥔 시대―.\n사람들은 일본으로 날아든 의문의 생물 ‘도깨비’를 신으로 숭상하고, 도깨비의 지배에 저항하는 ‘무사’를 괴물이라 꺼려한다.\n그런 와중에, 두 소년이 ‘무사’의 삶에 매료된다.\n세간의 거짓말과 끝없이 싸우는 무사시. 무가의 혈통을 직시하는 코지로. 목표는 ‘최강의 무사단’!\n두 사람의 끈끈한 유대로 세상을 쟁취하라!\n\nOrientⓒShinobu Ohtaka 2018\nAll rights reserved. First published in Japan in 2018 by Kodansha Ltd.\nElectronic Publishing rights for this Korean edition arranged through Kodansha Ltd.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":221,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":260,"change":{"type":"down","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":263,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":292,"change":{"type":"down","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":200,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":131,"change":{"type":"up","amount":69}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":190,"change":{"type":"down","amount":59}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":243,"change":{"type":"down","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":296,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":157,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-15","rank":209,"change":{"type":"down","amount":52}},{"date":"2026-09-16","rank":277,"change":{"type":"down","amount":68}},{"date":"2026-09-18","rank":154,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-19","rank":216,"change":{"type":"down","amount":62}},{"date":"2026-09-20","rank":232,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":300,"change":{"type":"down","amount":68}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":290,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-03","rank":193,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-04","rank":127,"change":{"type":"up","amount":66}},{"date":"2026-10-05","rank":